1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,855
Pulau kecil ini pernah dianggap
lebih berharga dari Manhattan.

2
00:00:03,855 --> 00:00:04,886
Pulau Run,

3
00:00:04,886 --> 00:00:05,596
di Banda,

4
00:00:05,596 --> 00:00:06,262
Maluku.

5
00:00:06,262 --> 00:00:06,929
Dulu,

6
00:00:06,929 --> 00:00:08,700
pala cuma tumbuh di Banda,

7
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,663
harganya selangit di Eropa.

8
00:00:10,663 --> 00:00:11,663
Masalahnya,

9
00:00:11,663 --> 00:00:12,824
Run dikuasai Inggris,

10
00:00:12,824 --> 00:00:15,038
padahal Belanda ingin memonopoli pala.

11
00:00:15,038 --> 00:00:16,497
Perang pun pecah.

12
00:00:16,497 --> 00:00:19,005
Tahun 1667,

13
00:00:19,005 --> 00:00:20,664
perjanjian damai diteken.

14
00:00:20,664 --> 00:00:22,050
Belanda dapat Run,

15
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:24,321
Inggris dapat Manhattan,

16
00:00:24,321 --> 00:00:26,072
yang kini jadi New York.

17
00:00:26,072 --> 00:00:26,857
Menurutmu,

18
00:00:26,857 --> 00:00:28,040
siapa yang untung?

19
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:29,894
Tulis di komentar.
